  "surface": {
    "brief": "The Board's Unattached agents section (#agents) at http://127.0.0.1:65362/",
    "briefText": "Baseline stage of the gui-improve walk on the unattached-agents panel. Tonight a worker whose cwd was a worktree appeared in that section with no way to see which tree it belonged to. The round's brief: make the section say where an unattached card's directory actually is and offer the right tree.",
    "url": "http://127.0.0.1:65362/",
    "selector": "#agents",
    "cardSelector": "#jobs .job[data-thread]",
    "board": "the main board (no Settings window open); the section sits under the New agent card, above #projects",
    "change": "The Unattached agents section must say where an unattached card's directory actually is, and its attach action must offer the tree that directory belongs to.",
    "changeSource": "Measured in this baseline, on a card whose cwd is a worktree the board has not read: the head's meta line reads 'no worktree' while the card's own cwd line names a .worktrees path; the only visible tree fact is the 10.5 px dim tail of that line (full path only in its title attribute); and the attach picker opens on a disabled placeholder naming only the tree's last path segment, with Attach disabled and no option carrying the card's tree. The section head's hint also asserts the card has no worktree of its own.",
    "reproduce": "This directory's capture.mjs boots its own sandbox of THIS tree (the stage tree with the implement stage's change-set applied) and the baseline's fixture board (two scanned repos, one worktree each for the unread repo, two seeded unattached cards), then shoots the same three states the baseline shot. public/ is read per request by the panel; lib/ needs a restart.",
    "scope": "The whole #agents section: its .project-head bar and #jobs with every card. The rest of the board is in the full-page shot only."
  },
  "round": {
    "branch": "wtgui/round-c-how-a-round-names-its-trees-5b3b85",
    "base": "99f2bd777a2a24d1aedd903e9c4b24a4d9520c36",
    "baseParent": "origin/main",
    "note": "This stage tree is the round parent (132354c1, two docs commits on 99f2bd7) and its public/, lib/ and server.js are byte-identical to the baseline's base 99f2bd7: git diff --stat 99f2bd7 HEAD -- public lib server.js is empty. The change-set (d813b435, ledger/gui-improve/change-set.patch) was applied to this tree with git apply -p1, so the after shots are the baseline's build plus that patch and nothing else."
  },
